<body>
    <!-- Progress bar -->
    <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>

    <!-- Navigation dots -->
    <nav class="nav-dots" id="navDots"></nav>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 1: TITLE
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide title-slide grid-bg" id="slide-1">
        <div class="corner-accent tl"></div>
        <div class="corner-accent br"></div>
        <div class="slide-number">01 / 08</div>
        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
            <p class="title-label">Research Paper Presentation</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">KnowSelf</h1>
        <p class="reveal subtitle" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
            Teaching LLM Agents When to Think, Reflect, or Seek Knowledge through Situational Self-Awareness
        </p>
        <p class="reveal source-ref" style="transition-delay: 0.55s;">
            arxiv.org/abs/2504.03553
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 2: PROBLEM - FLOOD IRRIGATION
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide grid-bg gradient-mesh" id="slide-2">
        <div class="slide-number">02 / 08</div>
        <div class="slide-content">
            <div class="slide-header reveal">
                <h2>Current Agent Training Uses "Flood Irrigation"</h2>
                <div class="accent-line"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s; font-size: var(--body-size); color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: clamp(0.3rem, 0.8vh, 0.6rem); line-height: 1.5;">
                Existing approaches indiscriminately inject gold trajectories, external feedback, or domain knowledge — regardless of whether the agent needs them at each step.
            </p>
            <div class="problem-grid">
                <div class="paradigm-card imitation reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
                    <span class="card-number">01</span>
                    <h3>Trajectory Imitation</h3>
                    <p class="examples">e.g. ReAct</p>
                    <p class="issue">Blindly copies gold action sequences — fragile when inputs deviate from training distribution.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="paradigm-card trial reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.35s;">
                    <span class="card-number">02</span>
                    <h3>Trial-and-Error Refinement</h3>
                    <p class="examples">e.g. Reflexion, ETO</p>
                    <p class="issue">Always reflects, even when unnecessary — wastes compute and can introduce spurious corrections.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="paradigm-card knowledge reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.5s;">
                    <span class="card-number">03</span>
                    <h3>Knowledge-Augmented</h3>
                    <p class="examples">e.g. KnowAgent, WKM, ExpeL</p>
                    <p class="issue">Injects knowledge at every step — costly and often counterproductive when the agent already knows the answer.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="vs-human reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.65s;">
                <span class="icon-brain">&#x1F9E0;</span>
                <p>Humans possess <strong>situational self-awareness</strong>: knowing when to act directly, when to pause and reflect, or when to seek help. KnowSelf brings this to LLM agents.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 3: THREE THINKING MODES
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide grid-bg gradient-mesh" id="slide-3">
        <div class="slide-number">03 / 08</div>
        <div class="slide-content">
            <div class="slide-header reveal">
                <h2>Three Situational Thinking Modes</h2>
                <div class="accent-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-diagram">
                <div class="flow-origin reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
                    Agent at Decision Step
                </div>
                <div class="flow-connector-down reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;"></div>
                <div class="flow-branch-row">
                    <div class="flow-branch-line reveal-left" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
                        <div class="flow-criterion">
                            <div class="criterion-label">Criterion</div>
                            <div class="criterion-text">Predicted action = Gold action?</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-connector-branch fast"></div>
                        <div class="thinking-card fast">
                            <div class="mode-icon">&#x26A1;</div>
                            <h3>Fast Thinking</h3>
                            <p class="mode-desc">Directly produce the correct action with minimal deliberation</p>
                            <span class="token-tag">&lt;fast&gt;</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flow-branch-line reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
                        <div class="flow-criterion">
                            <div class="criterion-label">Criterion</div>
                            <div class="criterion-text">Reflection corrects the initial error?</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-connector-branch slow"></div>
                        <div class="thinking-card slow">
                            <div class="mode-icon">&#x1F504;</div>
                            <h3>Slow Thinking</h3>
                            <p class="mode-desc">Self-correct through reflection after initial incorrect action</p>
                            <span class="token-tag">&lt;reflection&gt;</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flow-branch-line reveal-left" style="transition-delay: 0.5s; direction: rtl;">
                        <div class="flow-criterion" style="direction: ltr;">
                            <div class="criterion-label">Criterion</div>
                            <div class="criterion-text">Cannot correct even with reflection?</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-connector-branch know"></div>
                        <div class="thinking-card know" style="direction: ltr;">
                            <div class="mode-icon">&#x1F4DA;</div>
                            <h3>Knowledgeable Thinking</h3>
                            <p class="mode-desc">Must consult external knowledge base for the correct action</p>
                            <span class="token-tag">&lt;knowledge&gt;</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 4: KNOWSELF FRAMEWORK
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide grid-bg gradient-mesh" id="slide-4">
        <div class="slide-number">04 / 08</div>
        <div class="slide-content">
            <div class="slide-header reveal">
                <h2>KnowSelf Framework: Data to Deployment</h2>
                <div class="accent-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pipeline-container">
                <div class="pipeline-steps">
                    <div class="pipeline-step step1 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
                        <div class="step-number">Step 1</div>
                        <h3>Self-Awareness Data Construction</h3>
                        <div class="step-detail">
                            Agent <strong>self-explores</strong> the environment. At each step, heuristic criteria classify the situation and <strong>insert special tokens</strong> (&lt;fast&gt;, &lt;reflection&gt;, &lt;knowledge&gt;) into trajectories.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-arrow reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">
                        <div class="arrow-shape"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-step step2 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.35s;">
                        <div class="step-number">Step 2</div>
                        <h3>Two-Stage Training</h3>
                        <div class="step-detail">
                            <strong>Stage 1 — SFT:</strong> Teaches initial self-awareness patterns from labeled trajectories.<br>
                            <strong>Stage 2 — RPO:</strong> Reward-based Policy Optimization refines token generation for better situational judgment.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-arrow reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.45s;">
                        <div class="arrow-shape"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-step step3 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.55s;">
                        <div class="step-number">Step 3</div>
                        <h3>Self-Aware Inference</h3>
                        <div class="step-detail">
                            Agent <strong>autonomously generates special tokens</strong> that trigger: direct action (&lt;fast&gt;), self-reflection (&lt;reflection&gt;), or external knowledge retrieval (&lt;knowledge&gt;).
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="framework-image-container reveal-scale" style="transition-delay: 0.65s;">
                    <img src="assets/figure_3.jpg" alt="KnowSelf Framework: Data construction, learning, and inference pipeline">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 5: QUALITATIVE EXAMPLES
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide grid-bg gradient-mesh" id="slide-5">
        <div class="slide-number">05 / 08</div>
        <div class="slide-content">
            <div class="slide-header reveal">
                <h2>KnowSelf Correctly Acts Where Baselines Fail</h2>
                <div class="accent-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="examples-grid">
                <div class="example-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
                    <div class="task-name">Task: "Put a hot mug in cabinet"</div>
                    <div class="comparison-row">
                        <div class="comparison-item baseline">
                            <span class="method-label">OpenAI-O1</span>
                            <span class="method-detail">Incorrectly tries to take an egg from the microwave after opening it — fails to heat the mug</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="comparison-item knowself">
                            <span class="method-label">KnowSelf</span>
                            <span class="method-detail">Uses <span class="token-ref reflection">&lt;reflection&gt;</span> token to realize it should heat the mug using the open microwave — succeeds</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="example-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
                    <div class="task-name">Task: "Put a saltshaker in drawer"</div>
                    <div class="comparison-row">
                        <div class="comparison-item baseline">
                            <span class="method-label">DeepSeek-R1</span>
                            <span class="method-detail">Reflects that drawer is open, tries to close it first — action fails, stuck in loop</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="comparison-item knowself">
                            <span class="method-label">KnowSelf</span>
                            <span class="method-detail">Applies <span class="token-ref knowledge">&lt;knowledge&gt;</span> token: place object directly without removing unrelated items — succeeds</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="figure-container reveal-scale" style="transition-delay: 0.45s;">
                <img src="assets/figure_1.jpg" alt="Qualitative comparison of KnowSelf vs. OpenAI-O1 and DeepSeek-R1">
                <p class="figure-caption">Figure: Qualitative comparison showing KnowSelf's adaptive token usage vs. baselines</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         SLIDE 6: ALFWorld RESULTS TABLE
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="slide grid-bg gradient-mesh" id="slide-6">
        <div class="slide-number">06 / 08</div>
